            <div xml:id="m-4f5a54a7-120a-4071-9722-2beb0ac1cadf">
              <lg xml:id="m-89f82496-a571-4fc4-94e2-651549c8618e">
                <l xml:id="m-b2bde4a9-95eb-4e7f-82a8-68230f3acdc1" facs="#m-4e87eda6-c111-4dba-ace7-87b65a4f3fdf" label="text-like">Feast of the Sacred Heart of Jesus.</l><l xml:id="m-b19d8064-4765-4663-abc1-27df43217b02" facs="#m-6b3fd1f2-1c87-4bbd-93ac-e85e852b2f7b" label="ambiguous">989</l><l xml:id="m-257ccdcd-450c-44f6-9189-57d34cbaaf94" facs="#m-29f5ee4f-2b21-45f5-b84e-1cf696848e2e" label="text-like">At Bened.</l><l xml:id="m-66029f6c-80bf-4ba0-b4a4-120824cd569e" facs="#m-9c39ba38-7d13-4597-875d-46eae32b5305" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8. G</l><l xml:id="m-b8c1731a-c6e2-4e20-b99d-a78ee879c017" facs="#m-5d960ab2-ad45-4e1d-98f4-14ab5cd895e4" label="lyrics-like">Acta sunt “ enim haec, ut Scriptúra imple¬</l><l xml:id="m-d4375664-b206-46f2-a863-b00e1ffb00b9" facs="#m-638175fe-a2ff-4cd6-a636-c213e99a6dd8" label="ambiguous">4</l><l xml:id="m-d2268ce1-adc8-4d51-bfe4-bb94dfb458f7" facs="#m-47a6f2b8-5a87-47dc-ad70-6ccb8cf135a0" label="lyrics-like">ré- tur quae dí-cit: Vidébunt in quem transfixé-runt.</l><l xml:id="m-9f1f6285-ba1d-4a6d-95fa-e138be44ced5" facs="#m-da66b8ef-b9a9-46e3-ab3d-ff67b7dd871e" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-baf34ef8-f91d-4823-93a6-e6f7dc1a3f27" facs="#m-5d339860-31d0-4b17-bb04-e3743a760c24" label="text-like">Prayer. Deus qui nobis, in Corde. p. 971.</l><l xml:id="m-52939c20-7f41-4d9c-90b8-643596215fb2" facs="#m-81cae414-fe3b-4bb9-89d4-86966ba97f72" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Unus mílitum. D. 7</l><l xml:id="m-87a84a4f-1854-4172-851c-3bd5ff870d99" facs="#m-bb087a5a-ad9b-4f55-b448-df4d33351826" label="lyrics-like">In the Short Resp. N. Qui Córde fúndis grá-ti-am.</l><l xml:id="m-5655d0aa-a90f-459d-bc8e-5e7d53c8ce8c" facs="#m-0d4465d3-39cd-4f32-ab46-485ff3985a51" label="lyrics-like">Short Lesson. In caritáte. p. 976.</l><l xml:id="m-221e5e7f-b1b0-4cb4-9b8a-a632e9e43cf6" facs="#m-feb3eed5-87dd-439b-8792-2901f3fbfa88" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-7b915176-f5c7-45eb-9306-bcd364ea7ff8" facs="#m-fdd71322-fe3b-4bae-9efa-3d46a94bbeee" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-4048a9ea-183c-4b44-ba21-2c209992b1e7" facs="#m-62fdcddc-56fc-43aa-a5fd-512601cc85f6" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-b40d897a-e9d4-4a5a-961b-70d95132a4c0" facs="#m-31a871aa-92d9-4c67-b426-ec9b66f8da07" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nó- bis Spí-ri-tus, Unum Pátri cum</l><l xml:id="m-9a67bb67-74c6-4c23-a820-3e7e6e722301" facs="#m-a0930806-03f0-455f-8216-c5eb3d9d0f42" label="lyrics-like">Nóstro re fú-sus</l><l xml:id="m-9ad3b09b-0fb5-4e17-9d89-958b46b8e57d" facs="#m-fa18c906-523d-40e5-9251-501031af0e0d" label="lyrics-like">Fí-li-Digná-re prómptus ínge-ri</l><l xml:id="m-21b325a8-3325-4fdc-82df-63a90e063a23" facs="#m-db196b56-4894-49d0-b5ba-7128e3e5a648" label="lyrics-like">pé-cto-ri.</l><l xml:id="m-64029ff2-d7bc-4762-aa24-965dbe5402d0" facs="#m-853c6ffd-edb5-4048-bdf3-eea09e4b6fd7" label="lyrics-like">Jésu, tibi sit glória,</l><l xml:id="m-eec285d8-adf5-434a-81d9-504f38000bb6" facs="#m-9bed87a0-0916-4e11-9cb5-8e676626378e" label="lyrics-like">Os, língua, mens, sénsus, vígor,</l><l xml:id="m-ab58883c-47dc-4403-a992-622b94b75fb9" facs="#m-503a7399-8c35-4788-b5fb-61e25d35ba48" label="lyrics-like">Qui Córde fúndis grátiam,</l><l xml:id="m-d007bad2-15ca-44c0-b132-31be6f48d29c" facs="#m-21004518-a018-4449-ae7c-15fcbd4da955" label="lyrics-like">Confessiónem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-2e3f056b-ea84-48d5-abc5-3119a42b90bc" facs="#m-cb4cdab6-9721-4195-b051-34c1c20b7b07" label="lyrics-like">Cum Pâtre et álmõ Spíritu</l><l xml:id="m-28cbf9f8-b0b7-4495-8c07-08bc983bb80d" facs="#m-1774822c-82ee-4bca-80e6-6b5b1c6d6d8f" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat îgne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-8b4c0d81-5ff2-440e-8393-17efa7381882" facs="#m-254b32ff-cd99-4d65-bc79-023c41c0c68f" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdor próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-279ced5f-9913-438f-9f40-2f67c6a1d97d" facs="#m-2874563a-a039-4277-84bf-553c5e7b69e1" label="lyrics-like">In sempitérna saécula. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e0f18678-950b-4d85-bea3-a2f9916f413a" facs="#m-5b028d35-d4d3-4c04-a1f4-c6ddde6e906b" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Stans Jésus. p. 977. Chapter Fratres: Mihi. of second Vespers, p. 978.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
